ry":{"blocked_by":1,"total_blocked_by":1,"blocking":1,"total_blocking":1},"body":"# Network fabric\n\n## Purpose\nA documented, declarative network design sized for the cluster: fast east-west between nodes, scarce egress managed deliberately.\n\n## Scope\nSwitching and addressing plan replacing the torn-down v1.9 test layout (doc/talos-addresses.md is historical only). Confirm the exact high-speed NIC spec on core machines and the switch gear between them (needed to sanity-check LINSTOR/DRBD replication traffic). Management network for BMC/KVM. Edge: 2 Gbps symmetric Brightspeed fiber; egress strategy (tunnels to Cloudflare/Turso/Tailscale, compression) documented as design constraints. Existing notes: doc/network-topology.md, doc/inventory/routing-and-switching.md.\n\n## Execution mode\nHybrid: design and config online; cabling, switch install, and link verification physical.\n\n## Dependencies\nDepends on epic 1 (NIC inventory). Gates epic 6 bootstrap.\n\n## Acceptance\nAddressing + VLAN/segmentation plan committed; NIC/switch facts verified against hardware; management network reachable for every first-node machine.\n\n## Structure\n\nPart of the basement cluster program. Project home: `planning/roadmaps/basement-cluster.md` in this repo. Full program register: goal workspace `files/idea-register-2026-10-20.md` (Muse goal `goal_ba17a5777c21`). Detailed task issues are filed as sub-issues of this epic; dependencies use blocks / blocked-by links.\n\nHard rules for the whole program: no HashiCorp anything; everything bootstrappable from config, no hand-built state.\n","closed_by":{"login":"developing-today[bot]","id":347365078,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOFLRe1g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26439447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/developing-today","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.git